------- ELASTODYN v1.03.* INPUT FILE -------------------------------------------
SWT2.3-93.  Model done by E.Branlard using Siemens document LD-000-0299-00_SWT-2.9-93. Reference are made to the tables for each variable in this file (e.g. T3.1 for table 3.1)
---------------------- SIMULATION CONTROL --------------------------------------
False         Echo        - Echo input data to "<RootName>.ech" (flag)
          3   Method      - Integration method: {1: RK4, 2: AB4, or 3: ABM4} (-)
"default"     DT          - Integration time step (s)
