False          TwFADOF2    - TODO Second fore-aft tower bending-mode DOF (flag)
False          TwSSDOF1    - TODO First side-to-side tower bending-mode DOF (flag)
False          TwSSDOF2    - TODO Second side-to-side tower bending-mode DOF (flag)
