          0   PtfmRoll    - Initial or fixed roll tilt rotational displacement of platform (degrees)
          0   PtfmPitch   - Initial or fixed pitch tilt rotational displacement of platform (degrees)
          0   PtfmYaw     - Initial or fixed yaw rotational displacement of platform (degrees)
---------------------- TURBINE CONFIGURATION -----------------------------------
          3   NumBl       - Number of blades (-)
     46.310   TipRad      - Without accounting for skew, using HubRad=1.310m BladeLength=45m - The distance from the rotor apex to the blade tip (meters)
      1.310   HubRad      - T3.1[E]&[D]&[F] This can be computed two ways, so we took an average of the two. Using the blade flange coordinates with respect to the hub center ([E] and [D] from Tab3.1 and Fig3.1 of [S]),  gives: rh=sqrt(1309^2+46^2) = 1309.8. Or assuming that the coned-blade axis goes from the blade flange to the hub center, gives: rh=1309/cosd(2.7)=1310.5 - The distance from the rotor apex to the blade root (meters)
       -2.7   PreCone(1)  - T3.1[F]  - Blade 1 cone angle (degrees)
       -2.7   PreCone(2)  - T3.1[F]  - Blade 2 cone angle (degrees)
       -2.7   PreCone(3)  - T3.1[F]  - Blade 3 cone angle (degrees) [unused for 2 blades]
      0.186   HubCM       - T3.1[N]&[C] The hub COG is downwind of the hub center since [N]<[C] - Distance from rotor apex to hub mass [positive downwind] (meters)
          0   UndSling    -          - Undersling length [distance from teeter pin to the rotor apex] (meters) [unused for 3 blades]
          0   Delta3      -          - Delta-3 angle for teetering rotors (degrees) [unused for 3 blades]
          0   AzimB1Up    -          - Azimuth value to use for I/O when blade 1 points up (degrees)
     -3.587   OverHang    - T3.1[I]  - Distance from yaw axis to rotor apex [3 blades] or teeter pin [2 blades] [negative for upwind turbines] (meters)
      1.974   ShftGagL    - T3.1[J] NOTE: for output only, taken as the distance from rotor apex to main bearing     - Distance from rotor apex [3 blades] or teeter pin [2 blades] to shaft strain gages [positive for upwind rotors] (meters)
         -6   ShftTilt    - T3.4[L]     - Rotor shaft tilt angle (degrees)
     -0.808   NacCMxn     - T3.2  The nacelle is 808mm upwind from yaw axis    - Downwind distance from the tower-top to the nacelle CM (meters)
          0   NacCMyn     -          - Lateral  distance from the tower-top to the nacelle CM (meters)
      0.419   NacCMzn     - T3.2 Nacelle 419 mm above tower top - Vertical distance from the tower-top to the nacelle CM (meters)
     -0.808   NcIMUxn     - NOTE: for output only, set to the Nacelle COG     - Downwind distance from the tower-top to the nacelle IMU (meters)
          0   NcIMUyn     - NOTE: for output only, set to the Nacelle COG     - Lateral  distance from the tower-top to the nacelle IMU (meters)
      0.419   NcIMUzn     - NOTE: for output only, set to the Nacelle COG     - Vertical distance from the tower-top to the nacelle IMU (meters)
      1.097   Twr2Shft    - T3.4[M]     - Vertical distance from the tower-top to the rotor shaft (meters)
      78.54   TowerHt     - see Tower File         - Height of tower above ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] (meters)
          0   TowerBsHt   -          - Height of tower base above ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] (meters)
          0   PtfmCMxt    -          - Downwind distance from the ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] to the platform CM (meters)
          0   PtfmCMyt    -          - Lateral distance from the ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] to the platform CM (meters)
          0   PtfmCMzt    -          - Vertical distance from the ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] to the platform CM (meters)
          0   PtfmRefzt   -          - Vertical distance from the ground level [onshore] or MSL [offshore] to the platform reference point (meters)
---------------------- MASS AND INERTIA ----------------------------------------
          0   TipMass(1)  -      - Tip-brake mass, blade 1 (kg)
          0   TipMass(2)  -      - Tip-brake mass, blade 2 (kg)
          0   TipMass(3)  -      - Tip-brake mass, blade 3 (kg) [unused for 2 blades]
      25237   HubMass     - T3.1 - Hub mass (kg)
   4.38E+04   HubIner     - T3.1 taken as moment of inertia about the y-axis - Hub inertia about rotor axis [3 blades] or teeter axis [2 blades] (kg m^2)
    77.648    GenIner     - T3.6 Polar mass moment of inertia is 77.648 - Generator inertia about HSS (kg m^2)
      82591   NacMass     - Using T3.2 and adding 14t from integration of Shaft mass - Nacelle mass (kg)
    3.36+05   NacYIner    - T3.2 Taken as the inertia about the vertical z axis of BHawC - Nacelle inertia about yaw axis (kg m^2)
       1500   YawBrMass   - T4.1 NOTE: the top-flange mass was used here as YawBrMass since for now the lumped masses of Tab4.1 are not included in the tower. No information is provided about the yaw bearing mass - Yaw bearing mass (kg)
          0   PtfmMass    -      - Platform mass (kg)
          0   PtfmRIner   -      - Platform inertia for roll tilt rotation about the platform CM (kg m^2)
          0   PtfmPIner   -      - Platform inertia for pitch tilt rotation about the platform CM (kg m^2)
          0   PtfmYIner   -      - Platform inertia for yaw rotation about the platform CM (kg m^2)
